# AI Photo Magic

Mobile-friendly AI photo editing starter app.

Features:
- Photo upload
- Background change UI
- Clothes change UI
- AI enhance UI
- Prompt-based editing UI

## Important
Never put your Replicate API token in frontend JavaScript or commit `.env` to GitHub.
Copy `.env.example` to `.env` on your private server and add the token there.

The server endpoint is intentionally left with a model-selection placeholder because the exact Replicate image-edit model/version must be selected before production use.
